WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.366
Ringo and Bot were in the lab.

2
00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.147
"Oh boy!" Bot said.

3
00:00:10.148 --> 00:00:12.831
"I'm getting a new booster!"

4
00:00:12.832 --> 00:00:15.538
Ringo pulled a box off a shelf.

5
00:00:15.539 --> 00:00:18.947
Crash!

6
00:00:18.948 --> 00:00:22.820
Robot parts spilled across the floor.

7
00:00:22.821 --> 00:00:26.129
"Oops," Ringo said.

8
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.877
He stepped over the robot parts.

9
00:00:30.878 --> 00:00:34.584
Bot really wanted a booster.

10
00:00:34.585 --> 00:00:39.396
"A booster will make me faster!" she said.

11
00:00:39.397 --> 00:00:42.611
Ringo scratched his head.

12
00:00:42.612 --> 00:00:48.922
"I don't see any boosters here."

13
00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:52.280
"Can we buy one?" Bot asked.

14
00:00:52.281 --> 00:00:59.242
Ringo shrugged. "Why not?"

15
00:00:59.243 --> 00:01:01.801
Ringo turned on a computer.

16
00:01:01.802 --> 00:01:10.791
"I'll look for a store," he said.

17
00:01:10.792 --> 00:01:13.419
"Aha!" Ringo said.

18
00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:16.361
"Robo Mart has boosters.

19
00:01:16.362 --> 00:01:19.318
It's on Planet Nitro."

20
00:01:19.319 --> 00:01:24.090
"Let's go!" Bot said.

21
00:01:24.091 --> 00:01:31.037
Ringo and Bot went to the spaceport.

22
00:01:31.038 --> 00:01:34.761
They went into a spaceship.

23
00:01:34.762 --> 00:01:38.717
Ringo sat in his seat.

24
00:01:38.718 --> 00:01:40.883
"Blast off!"

25
00:01:40.884 --> 00:01:44.240
The spaceship left the spaceport.

26
00:01:44.241 --> 00:01:46.834
Then it slowed down.

27
00:01:46.835 --> 00:01:51.709
"Hey! What's happening?" Ringo said.

28
00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:55.373
"We're going backward!" Bot said.

29
00:01:55.374 --> 00:02:02.717
They were back at the base!

30
00:02:02.718 --> 00:02:08.113
An officer looked up at them.

31
00:02:08.114 --> 00:02:15.512
"Come out of the spaceship right now!"

